      "order": 2,
      "block_id": "42553acc-2bc0-44fa-89ed-32ae5ff86781",
      "source_hash": "e76b8311a1b5d900951d87f0c61ca5e9e1dd5913fc2ea4424db2f3743e58bc9b",
      "markdown": "- 수업일정관리의 대상 날짜와 시간",
      "interpretation": "source_snapshot_not_new_teacher_verdict"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_text",
      "parent_heading_block_id": "bd62a9a2-035d-455c-af7b-dba7db7ecd3e",
      "order": 3,
      "block_id": "540c1f1c-7fcb-4372-aa4c-53da71c9dc31",
      "source_hash": "beceb885ab46bd9640406d524f1b48eb90af8f1c1d48a73983a9d7f3864fdf95",
      "markdown": "- 학생별 등록 과정, 반, 부, 요일과 적용 시작일",
      "interpretation": "source_snapshot_not_new_teacher_verdict"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_text",
      "parent_heading_block_id": "bd62a9a2-035d-455c-af7b-dba7db7ecd3e",
